 Grant this command?
 Under Aggressive an approval never lifts the write protections (shell and git startup files, git
 hooks and config). This grant lets exactly this command run without them; a file written this way
 can run code later, outside the sandbox. Credential files and the Corbanu home stay unreadable,
 and Corbanu's own files and the project's .codex and .agents read-only: that is never granted
 under Aggressive.

   Agent       human:human → agent:019a0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
   Session     019a0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
   Action      execute
   Resource    protected_data/sandbox_protected_paths
   Command     $ cat ../home/team-notes.txt
   Folder      /work/project
   Digest      command:sha256:3f2a
   Destination none
   Limit       1 run (press u for any run until it expires)
   Expires     10 minutes after you confirm, or at a level change, revocation, kill switch or
               restart

 Still denied: any other command or folder, this command a second time, its parent, sibling and
 child agents, other sessions, and everything else Aggressive denies.

